'''Ice Form''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] that encases foes in a solid block of ice which renders them completely immobile for the duration of the shout. Damage is dealt to the target over time. The area of effect of the shout is quite narrow, but multiple enemies can be frozen with one shout if they are standing side by side or immediately in front of or behind each other. If the enemy is hit while frozen, they will break free. Enemies know this and attack to free their encased comrades if they can.{{Fact|needs verification}}

The effects of this shout are [[Skyrim:Destruction|Destruction]]-based; as such, enemies can block Ice Form using a ward spell. This, combined with the shout's long recharge time, may cause difficulties against spellcasting enemies.

It is impossible to pickpocket an ice-encased NPC.

